## Version 0.1.3
Date: 2026-02-23

### Changes
- Improved stop-loss hedge retry behavior after partial FAK fills so follow-up hedges are not blocked by long pending-order TTL.
- Hedge pending-order guard now uses a short recent window tied to hedge inflight timing.
- Increased default hedge price aggressiveness by setting fallback `SNIPER_EXIT_HEDGE_SLIPPAGE_TICKS` to `2` in code.

### Implementation Notes
- Hedge re-submit blocking now checks `_has_pending_taker_order_recent(...)` instead of full TTL pending state.
- Behavior is implemented in sniper hedge path (`src/bot.rs`) without changing non-hedge stop-loss modes.

## Version 0.1.2
Date: 2026-02-23

### Changes
- Added FORCE-DIFF sniper entry trigger via `SNIPER_FORCE_ENTRY_MIN_DIFF_PRICE` (with max-age override) that can bypass normal entry min/max time windows.

### Implementation Notes
- FORCE-DIFF trigger uses RTDS snapshot diff sign to select side and still reuses FORCE entry RTDS gate checks before submit.

## Version 0.1.1
Date: 2026-02-23

### Changes
- Added stop-loss hedge mode support using `SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_MODE=HEDGE`.
- Added compatibility alias `SNIPER_STOP_LESS_MODE` for stop-loss mode lookup.
- Simplified runtime config flow so stop-loss hedge can be enabled with one mode flag.
- Updated `stable.env` to use `SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_MODE=HEDGE`.

### Implementation Notes
- Stop-loss hedge trigger is wired in sniper exit logic (`src/bot.rs`), with behavior selected by stop-loss mode.
- Build/version string automatically reflects the crate version via `CARGO_PKG_VERSION`.
